| cell      | R1 ratio | control | | cell      | R1 ratio | control |
|-----------|---------:|--------:|-|-----------|---------:|--------:|
| 256  p6   | 0.9739   | 0.9988  | | 512  p6   | 0.9686   | 0.9998  |
| 256  p8   | 0.9794   | 1.0003  | | 512  p8   | 0.9759   | 1.0023  |
| 256  p10  | 0.9513   | 0.9945  | | 512  p10  | 0.9624   | 1.0020  |
| 256  p13  | 0.9613   | 0.9994  | | 512  p13  | 0.9624   | 0.9989  |
| 1024 p6   | 0.9694   | 1.0014  | | 1024 p10  | 0.9498   | 0.9991  |
| 1024 p8   | 0.9724   | 1.0013  | | 1024 p13  | 0.9507   | 1.0029  |

Twelve of twelve outside the band = **1.021x to 1.053x**; twelve of twelve
control cells inside it.

